      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "RMI Enumeration",
      "questDescription": "Dana Osei needs the historian's Java RMI exposure documented. Enumerate the registry, identify its published object, and compare the advertised endpoint with the address you contacted.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> The remotely reachable registry disclosed HistorianFeed and a loopback endpoint in its stub. Invocation and impact still require separate testing.",
      "questCharacterID": "u05_dana_osei",
      "appScenarioID": ""
    },
    {
      "persona": "Blackhat Hacker",
      "questName": "RMI Enumeration",
      "questDescription": "Reyes Calloway treats the reachable RMI registry as a source of service metadata. Enumerate its object name and inspect the endpoint published in the returned stub.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Reyes Calloway:</b> The registry exposed HistorianFeed and advertised 127.0.1.1:41855. Useful metadata, but not proof that the object can be invoked remotely.",
      "questCharacterID": "u05_reyes_calloway",
      "appScenarioID": ""
    },
    {
      "persona": "Hacktivist",
      "questName": "RMI Enumeration",
      "questDescription": "Priya Nandan wants the Java registry finding recorded without exaggeration. Identify what it discloses and distinguish registry reachability from object access.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Priya Nandan:</b> The registry disclosed a named object and loopback endpoint to the authorized tester. That is verified information exposure; object access remains untested.",
